{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bloated_corpse","model_identifier":"bloated_corpse","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# bloated_corpse\n\nBloated corpse (C1), walker, 1.9 m = 68 u tall, about 1.1-1.3 m (40-46 u) wide.\n\nA swollen purple-grey dead thing: stretched, shiny, split skin with sickly green light glowing through the splits (glow_split_* cubes), a small head sunk into the shoulders, pale green eye lights, huge heavy fists and stumpy legs. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names; proportions changed only by pivots.\n\n- Cubes: 23 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -24.0..24.0, y 0.0..67.0, z -16.6..12.6 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 40 x 68 x 26 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -1, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop | heaving breaths (slight torso scale) |\n| `walk` | 1.6 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `attack_slam` | 1.6 | once | key 0.85 s: both fists hit the ground in front (hits an arc in front, about 100 degrees, reach 30 u) |\n| `aggro` | 1.8 | once | rears back and beats its belly |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once |  |\n| `burn` | 1.5 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n| `burst` | 1.8 | hold | death of this creature: swells and shudders (scale keys on `torso`), bursts at 1.05-1.15 s (spawn the green burst effect at 1.1 s), falls back and lies as a deflated heap; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `death` | 1.8 | hold | identical copy of `burst` so generic death code works |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 24.9 u/s (0.70 m/s), cycle 1.6 s, 39.8 u per cycle (heavy waddle)\n- `run`: 64.0 u/s (1.80 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 64.0 u per cycle (lumbering)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_slam`: key 0.85 s: both fists hit the ground in front (hits an arc in front, about 100 degrees, reach 30 u)\n- `burst`: death of this creature: swells and shudders (scale keys on `torso`), bursts at 1.05-1.15 s (spawn the green burst effect at 1.1 s), falls back and lies as a deflated heap; holds; rests on y = 0\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 67, -8)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 42.5, 13.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (6.5, 50.5, 13.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (11.5, 60.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 38.5, -13.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (19, 27, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-24, 38, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-19, 27, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (14, 23, 8.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-14, 23, 8.5)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Uses `scale` keyframes on the torso bone in idle/walk (breathing) and in burst/death (swell and deflate).\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_split_* are the lit cubes.\n"},"description":"# bloated_corpse\n\nBloated corpse (C1), walker, 1.9 m = 68 u tall, about 1.1-1.3 m (40-46 u) wide.\n\nA swollen purple-grey dead thing: stretched, shiny, split skin with sickly green light glowing through the splits (glow_split_* cubes), a small head sunk into the shoulders, pale green eye lights, huge heavy fists and stumpy legs. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names; proportions changed only by pivots.\n\n- Cubes: 23 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -24.0..24.0, y 0.0..67.0, z -16.6..12.6 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 40 x 68 x 26 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -1, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop | heaving breaths (slight torso scale) |\n| `walk` | 1.6 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `attack_slam` | 1.6 | once | key 0.85 s: both fists hit the ground in front (hits an arc in front, about 100 degrees, reach 30 u) |\n| `aggro` | 1.8 | once | rears back and beats its belly |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once |  |\n| `burn` | 1.5 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n| `burst` | 1.8 | hold | death of this creature: swells and shudders (scale keys on `torso`), bursts at 1.05-1.15 s (spawn the green burst effect at 1.1 s), falls back and lies as a deflated heap; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `death` | 1.8 | hold | identical copy of `burst` so generic death code works |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 24.9 u/s (0.70 m/s), cycle 1.6 s, 39.8 u per cycle (heavy waddle)\n- `run`: 64.0 u/s (1.80 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 64.0 u per cycle (lumbering)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_slam`: key 0.85 s: both fists hit the ground in front (hits an arc in front, about 100 degrees, reach 30 u)\n- `burst`: death of this creature: swells and shudders (scale keys on `torso`), bursts at 1.05-1.15 s (spawn the green burst effect at 1.1 s), falls back and lies as a deflated heap; holds; rests on y = 0\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 67, -8)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 42.5, 13.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (6.5, 50.5, 13.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (11.5, 60.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 38.5, -13.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (19, 27, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-24, 38, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-19, 27, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (14, 23, 8.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-14, 23, 8.5)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Uses `scale` keyframes on the torso bone in idle/walk (breathing) and in burst/death (swell and deflate).\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_split_* are the lit cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-13.0,20.0,-9.0],"to":[13.0,24.0,9.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":